{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "meta": {
    "title": "Hub past what one channel holds",
    "subtitle": "Thirty components on one, which is past both the ceiling and the page size the composer contemplates"
  },
  "provenance": {
    "origin": "handwritten",
    "note": "The companion to hub.codegraph.json. That one fits once channels follow demand; this one does not, and exists so the ceiling on that widening is seen to fire. A ceiling never observed refusing anything is indistinguishable from one never written. The count is above expandedMaxBoxes on purpose: a page this dense is not a hub, it is a page nothing would rescue."
  },
